																		Wine all you want, this author commentary is gonna be grape.
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607633160" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;" >Ihp</a></span> <span class="odate time_1546476754 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">03 Jan 2019 00:52</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4106588">
									

<p>Me in 2018: &quot;I can't think of anything for Cliche Con&quot;</p>
<p>Me in 2019: &quot;Hey, cool corkscrew. WAITAMINUTE.&quot;</p>
<p>This is based off of an actual item I have in my house&#8212; it's sitting on my desk right now, and was owned by my grandmother. The inspiration came to me last night, and I figured &quot;I could make <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">a religion</span> a skip out of this.&quot;</p>
<p>This is an attempt at a humorous SCP and&#8230; it might not be my best one, but after enough tweaking, I'm mostly fine with it. Hopefully it stands out enough among the other cliches.</p>
<p>Thanks to Aismallard, Ensophos, and RockTeethMothEyes for looking over this.</p>
<p>Picture taken by myself.</p>
<p>The cliche this is intended to cover is Anomaly Cliche 1: &quot;Compulsion effect that makes you do bad things/kills you.&quot;</p>
<p>And yes, the Task Force Name is a reference to the best John Mulaney bit. Credit to LordStoneFish for that.</p>

