			<div class="content" id="post-content-4109688">
									

<p>To be honest, the entire family seems to have problems, so all bets are off. And it's probably not actually champagne, just some fizzy white wine. Maybe even just regular cheap plonk with soda water added afterwards&#8230; Or it's sufficiently corked enough to go flat.</p>
